[
 {
  "file": "h1",
  "text": "In Arabic, 'beautiful' and 'camel' are built from the same three letters.",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "b1",
  "text": "This is jameel: beautiful. Its three root letters: jeem, meem, laam.",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "b2",
  "text": "Keep those three letters, change the vowels, and you get jamal: a camel.",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "b3",
  "text": "To the Arabs, a herd of camels was beauty and wealth in one. Allah even says it about livestock:",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "b3b",
  "text": "And for you there is beauty in them.",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "b4",
  "text": "The same letters give you jumla: a sentence. Many words, gathered into one.",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "t1",
  "text": "Your turn. The Prophet, peace be upon him, said: Allah is jameel, and He loves al-jamaal. Is al-jamaal camels, or beauty?",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "b5",
  "text": "Beauty. Allah is beautiful, and He loves beauty.",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
  "file": "end",
  "text": "Tag someone beautiful. Just maybe don't call them a camel.",
  "voice": "N2lVS1w4EtoT3dr4eOWO",
  "stability": 0.35,
  "style": 0.45,
  "speed": 1.05
 },
 {
